* Owned synthetic regulator model for software regression tests; not vendor qualification.
* 3.3 V reference with 1 mV/V line sensitivity, 0.3 V dropout and 50 mohm output resistance.
.subckt ldo IN GND OUT
E1 REG GND VALUE={min(3.3+0.001*(V(IN,GND)-5), V(IN,GND)-0.3)}
RO REG OUT 0.05
RQ IN GND 100k
.ends ldo
